        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BP-T8, American Relic Collection Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion's American Relic Collection is made up of beautiful levers and the Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rose is no exception. A sandcast lever, each one is as unique as the mold that shaped it. Choose from antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. All of the offered finishes are textured to add to the rustic charm of the piece. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Fusion BP-T8 American Relic Collection Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rose is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten brass is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rosette Fusion BP-T8:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the American Relic Collection Flintlock Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
