                "description": "Fusion BP-T8, Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rose - Fusion's American Relic Collection is made up of beautiful levers and the Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rose is no exception. A sandcast lever, each one is as unique as the mold that shaped it. Choose from antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. All of the offered finishes are textured to add to the rustic charm of the piece. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Fusion BP-T8 American Relic Collection Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Rose is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.",
